{"id":"n14541-3-7","stage":3,"title":"복 · 运","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14541-3-7-1","ko":"피자 먹고 있었구나. 맛있겠다.","zh":"原来你正在吃披萨啊，一定很好吃吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"피자","meaning":"比萨","explanation":"피자：比萨","readings":[{"term":"피자","audio":"/audio/383a267d08e55bc1b4c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26909","senseId":"1","lemma":"피자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"피자","audio":"/audio/383a267d08e55bc1b4c9.mp3"}},{"text":"먹고","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹고","audio":"/audio/b2dca7d94e3e3049878e.mp3"}},{"text":"있었구나.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있었구나","audio":"/audio/a46362544e64d18a19c2.mp3"}},{"text":"맛있겠다.","meaning":"好吃，可口，香","explanation":"맛있다：好吃，可口，香；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"맛있다","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70811","senseId":"1","lemma":"맛있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맛있겠다","audio":"/audio/a1b9bc71256da428d8bd.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"383a267d08e55bc1","term":"피자","zh":"比萨","audio":"/audio/383a267d08e55bc1b4c9.mp3","entryId":"26909","definition":"一种源于意大利的食物，在圆而扁的面饼上面覆盖番茄、肉类、奶酪以及其他配料，并烘烤而成。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"21e91ac8a208ff9e","term":"맛있다","zh":"好吃，可口，香","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3","entryId":"70811","definition":"食物的味道好。","pronunciation":["마딛따","마싣따"]}],"audio":"/audio/b480f035d1fcc8e3cc70.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14541-3-7-2","ko":"어서 와서 같이 먹어. 너는 정말 먹을 복이 많은가 봐.","zh":"快过来一起吃吧，你看你真是福气满满呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어서","meaning":"快","explanation":"어서：快","readings":[{"term":"어서","audio":"/audio/596b9885add9128d0c53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67026","senseId":"1","lemma":"어서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어서","audio":"/audio/596b9885add9128d0c53.mp3"}},{"text":"와서","meaning":"来，来到","explanation":"오다：来，来到；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"와서","audio":"/audio/fff1948ffcab0f48d739.mp3"}},{"text":"같이","meaning":"一同，一块儿，共同","explanation":"같이：一同，一块儿，共同","readings":[{"term":"같이","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26799","senseId":"2","lemma":"같이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같이","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3"}},{"text":"먹어.","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹어","audio":"/audio/65922367ccfa237c5c51.mp3"}},{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너는","audio":"/audio/54abca9caefe5ae47b8e.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"먹을","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹을","audio":"/audio/0b0d8e241feedb60eb70.mp3"}},{"text":"복이","meaning":"运，福气","explanation":"복：运，福气；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"복","audio":"/audio/e9c83f3163848149a436.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14541","senseId":"3","lemma":"복","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"복이","audio":"/audio/33a59dc4f12733bfe710.mp3"}},{"text":"많은가","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；은가：引出疑问或推测的内容，常与 보다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많은가","audio":"/audio/9ff2144d1f82568e0137.mp3"}},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐","audio":"/audio/fdcffec86114c54dd4e0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"596b9885add9128d","term":"어서","zh":"快","audio":"/audio/596b9885add9128d0c53.mp3","entryId":"67026","definition":"用于催促做事或行动。","pronunciation":["어서"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"从别的地方移动到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"d44da011993f2a6e","term":"같이","zh":"一同，一块儿，共同","audio":"/audio/d4